\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {(a)}~The screen of \S  \ref {sec:method} over the 31 cells that carry a selection-split gate: CKA filters none of them, and no cell meets the degradation definition. \textbf  {(b)}~The same cells as CKA against held-out $\Delta _\text  {enc}$ (positive ${=}$ freezing better): no cut on CKA separates the cells adaptation helped from the cells it hurt. The labelled pairs are the running example: Moirai-Base's two \emph  {least} drifted cells are its only two that degrade, and its two most drifted improve the most (\S  \ref {sec:exp3}). Filled markers clear the gate; both $\rho $ are clustered by backbone${\times }$dataset, and only Moirai has enough cells to estimate one within a backbone (Appendix~\ref {app:clustered}).}}{2}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:screen}{{1}{2}{\textbf {(a)}~The screen of \S \ref {sec:method} over the 31 cells that carry a selection-split gate: CKA filters none of them, and no cell meets the degradation definition. \textbf {(b)}~The same cells as CKA against held-out $\denc $ (positive ${=}$ freezing better): no cut on CKA separates the cells adaptation helped from the cells it hurt. The labelled pairs are the running example: Moirai-Base's two \emph {least} drifted cells are its only two that degrade, and its two most drifted improve the most (\S \ref {sec:exp3}). Filled markers clear the gate; both $\rho $ are clustered by backbone${\times }$dataset, and only Moirai has enough cells to estimate one within a backbone (Appendix~\ref {app:clustered})}{figure.caption.1}{}}
